(7293324, 1136873, 64086, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition,atmosphere and processing. My only nitpick is that I think the fisherman is a distraction. My eye goes right to them with all the leading lines and the way they(and the pole) cross the clouds it doesn''t add anything. If they were in a "clear" spot with a good silhouette shape it could be a good addition. Anyway, great job and good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful composition,atmosphere and processing. My only nitpick is that I think the fisherman is a distraction. My eye goes right to them with all the leading lines and the way they(and the pole) cross the clouds it doesn''t add anything. If they were in a "clear" spot with a good silhouette shape it could be a good addition. Anyway, great job and good luck.', '2014-12-16 06:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293326, 1137000, 64086, '<td valign="top">I like the mood, the tones and the layers. The pentagon in the center seems too distracting for me. I think the curve on the bottom is great but maybe a little less texture to the right of it. My eye is drawn to the textures and to the dark corners first and then to the curves and land. Nice job.</td>', 'I like the mood, the tones and the layers. The pentagon in the center seems too distracting for me. I think the curve on the bottom is great but maybe a little less texture to the right of it. My eye is drawn to the textures and to the dark corners first and then to the curves and land. Nice job.', '2014-12-16 06:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293327, 1136698, 64086, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture and composition. Can''t figure out what it is, but I''d hang it on my wall.</td>', 'Wonderful texture and composition. Can''t figure out what it is, but I''d hang it on my wall.', '2014-12-16 06:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293334, 1137000, 50864, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Great layers, nice choice of colors, lovely smudging and interesting area at the bottom. One of my favorites.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Great layers, nice choice of colors, lovely smudging and interesting area at the bottom. One of my favorites.', '2014-12-16 08:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
