(7293775, 1136684, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m not as much a fan of the photo as I am of what you did making it (I would have just moved on had I not read the title).  Tough to wrap my head around it and actually give it a score, so I''m not - at least not for now - because I would give different scores for the technique and the result (which I <i>might</i> have cropped a touch).</td>', 'I''m not as much a fan of the photo as I am of what you did making it (I would have just moved on had I not read the title).  Tough to wrap my head around it and actually give it a score, so I''m not - at least not for now - because I would give different scores for the technique and the result (which I might have cropped a touch).', '2014-12-18 07:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293776, 1136981, 156466, '<td valign="top">Amazing that the tulips didn''t move in 30 seconds.  Nice photo, but one you could have entered in any challenge.</td>', 'Amazing that the tulips didn''t move in 30 seconds.  Nice photo, but one you could have entered in any challenge.', '2014-12-18 07:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293777, 1136937, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the wide angle distortion here.  Might have been more interesting if you were to capture the person in a couple places within the frame across the exposure time, contemplating the glass from different distances.</td>', 'Not a fan of the wide angle distortion here.  Might have been more interesting if you were to capture the person in a couple places within the frame across the exposure time, contemplating the glass from different distances.', '2014-12-18 07:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293779, 1136944, 156466, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the center composition, but the way the pier seems to bend right along the path I''m wondering if it would have been better to have moved left and used the board to lead in from the corned.  Still, well captured and processed.</td>', 'I don''t mind the center composition, but the way the pier seems to bend right along the path I''m wondering if it would have been better to have moved left and used the board to lead in from the corned.  Still, well captured and processed.', '2014-12-18 07:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293780, 1136873, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  The trees are just a little "off", like they''re artifacted in some way.  Bothered by the amount of left corner vignette as well.  Still really nice.</td>', 'Lovely image.  The trees are just a little "off", like they''re artifacted in some way.  Bothered by the amount of left corner vignette as well.  Still really nice.', '2014-12-18 08:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293781, 1136964, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really, really nice, but I can''t get over the feel that it leans left a little.  The foreground reflection is also a little disjoint for me.  I love the soft colors in the rest of it.  7</td>', 'Really, really nice, but I can''t get over the feel that it leans left a little.  The foreground reflection is also a little disjoint for me.  I love the soft colors in the rest of it.  7', '2014-12-18 08:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293782, 1136885, 156466, '<td valign="top">Just too structured and sharpened for my taste.  I don''t need it to be ethereal and pretty like everyone else''s water shot, but this is just over the top and not in a good way.</td>', 'Just too structured and sharpened for my taste.  I don''t need it to be ethereal and pretty like everyone else''s water shot, but this is just over the top and not in a good way.', '2014-12-18 08:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293783, 1136993, 156466, '<td valign="top">Holy angled composition, Batman!!</td>', 'Holy angled composition, Batman!!', '2014-12-18 08:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293800, 1136957, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very eery, but very cool.</td>', 'Very eery, but very cool.', '2014-12-18 09:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293807, 1136944, 13077, '<td valign="top">The water sure has an attractive texture to it, and the motion in the dramatic clouds was well captured. The composition is a little atypical for this type of photo, but I feel it adds to the drama so I like it.</td>', 'The water sure has an attractive texture to it, and the motion in the dramatic clouds was well captured. The composition is a little atypical for this type of photo, but I feel it adds to the drama so I like it.', '2014-12-18 10:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293809, 1136969, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2014-12-18 10:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7293845, 1136997, 91730, '<td valign="top">I realize the blur and seeing double was done on purpose, but it makes my eyes hurt. Still a good photo though and well done.</td>', 'I realize the blur and seeing double was done on purpose, but it makes my eyes hurt. Still a good photo though and well done.', '2014-12-18 12:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
