(7294013, 1136980, 53814, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kasaba:</b></div><hr/><i> I hope you will share the secrets of this picture after voting </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Gaby...  I focused on the black cat, tripped shutter to fire the on-camera flash and illuminate the cat eyes (flash set at first curtain), put my hand over lens, manually refocused on trees, pointed camera at trees, removed hand from lens for a few seconds, put hand over lens, moved camera, exposed for another few seconds on different part of trees, repeated one more time on trees. Put my hand over lens for the remaining few seconds. Processed with a few Topaz filters to increase contrast. I thought the "creature" looked like "Mighty Mouse", and that''s the reason for the  title.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by kasaba: I hope you will share the secrets of this picture after voting   Thanks Gaby...  I focused on the black cat, tripped shutter to fire the on-camera flash and illuminate the cat eyes (flash set at first curtain), put my hand over lens, manually refocused on trees, pointed camera at trees, removed hand from lens for a few seconds, put hand over lens, moved camera, exposed for another few seconds on different part of trees, repeated one more time on trees. Put my hand over lens for the remaining few seconds. Processed with a few Topaz filters to increase contrast. I thought the "creature" looked like "Mighty Mouse", and that''s the reason for the  title. ', '2014-12-19 00:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7294018, 1136996, 113591, '<td valign="top">Heartfelt. Engaging. Thanks.<br/></td>', 'Heartfelt. Engaging. Thanks.', '2014-12-19 00:23:35.000000', NULL, 0),
