(7294084, 1136980, 141319, '<td valign="top">Really sorry this didn''t do better, but kind of expected it with DPC voters - the landscapes that came in for ribbons ARE stunning, but I still love this. My favorite of the challenge because it is different. Thanks for sharing the secret of the image ... not that I can see any trees ... ;-). <br/></td>', 'Really sorry this didn''t do better, but kind of expected it with DPC voters - the landscapes that came in for ribbons ARE stunning, but I still love this. My favorite of the challenge because it is different. Thanks for sharing the secret of the image ... not that I can see any trees ... ;-). ', '2014-12-19 07:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
