(7294380, 1137000, 123833, '<td valign="top">Anita, DPC is getting to be very weird as the number of votes is getting to be at all time low. Soon the score will be totally meaningless, statistically insignificant, and completely not worth bothering about. The death of DPC is coming sooner than later, your image is the proof.</td>', 'Anita, DPC is getting to be very weird as the number of votes is getting to be at all time low. Soon the score will be totally meaningless, statistically insignificant, and completely not worth bothering about. The death of DPC is coming sooner than later, your image is the proof.', '2014-12-20 08:57:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7294429, 1136996, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes, that''s a thrilling photograph.  I didn''t look at the Challenge because I couldn''t stand yet another picture of waves smoothed into silken smoke by time.  Your picture is a beautiful exception to the banal.  Thank you.</td>', 'Yes, that''s a thrilling photograph.  I didn''t look at the Challenge because I couldn''t stand yet another picture of waves smoothed into silken smoke by time.  Your picture is a beautiful exception to the banal.  Thank you.', '2014-12-20 14:09:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7294508, 1136996, 124815, '<td valign="top">My highest vote, 9, and by far the most interesting image. Did not have time for comments but I am struck by the emotional aspect of the shot. It''s truly the 30 seconds of life captured intensely</td>', 'My highest vote, 9, and by far the most interesting image. Did not have time for comments but I am struck by the emotional aspect of the shot. It''s truly the 30 seconds of life captured intensely', '2014-12-20 23:50:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7294512, 1136957, 124815, '<td valign="top">I played a lot with this image on my screen and concluded that for me it would be far more poignant if the third upper part would be cropped. This exercise might fall into the so often mentioned adage "less is more". The absence of the hand makes the image incredibly powerful.<br/>By the way, I gave it 8.</td>', 'I played a lot with this image on my screen and concluded that for me it would be far more poignant if the third upper part would be cropped. This exercise might fall into the so often mentioned adage "less is more". The absence of the hand makes the image incredibly powerful.By the way, I gave it 8.', '2014-12-20 23:56:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7294514, 1136982, 124815, '<td valign="top">I liked this a lot and the title makes it even more poignant. This is an existential photograph. Life, with open eyes. <br/>Yet, there is something missing, perhaps I needed more space on both sides of the shot.the eyes wonder too much and the attention is lost.<br/>It was 8 from me</td>', 'I liked this a lot and the title makes it even more poignant. This is an existential photograph. Life, with open eyes. Yet, there is something missing, perhaps I needed more space on both sides of the shot.the eyes wonder too much and the attention is lost.It was 8 from me', '2014-12-21 00:00:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7294532, 1137000, 124815, '<td valign="top">I much prefer the outtake. This one, although I marked it 7, left me unclear about my own reaction. And it''s a bit wobbly itself - things are either curved or straight, my eyes are searching for something to grasp in a sea of maroonish sepia. This is of course my own reading as blunt as I could have put it but the image itself was among one of my highest marked in this challenge.<br/>The outtake has extraordinary power and it''s like a grave piece of music. You could have posted it in the "painting" challenge although I prefer to relate to its musicality.</td>', 'I much prefer the outtake. This one, although I marked it 7, left me unclear about my own reaction. And it''s a bit wobbly itself - things are either curved or straight, my eyes are searching for something to grasp in a sea of maroonish sepia. This is of course my own reading as blunt as I could have put it but the image itself was among one of my highest marked in this challenge.The outtake has extraordinary power and it''s like a grave piece of music. You could have posted it in the "painting" challenge although I prefer to relate to its musicality.', '2014-12-21 00:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7294536, 1136684, 124815, '<td valign="top">Mighty interesting photograph. I knew exactly what it was being a fan of Abelardo Morell.<br/>It was 7 from me, not more because the bright colors did not take me into the "obscure" realm and became too technical.<br/>Wonderful exercice.</td>', 'Mighty interesting photograph. I knew exactly what it was being a fan of Abelardo Morell.It was 7 from me, not more because the bright colors did not take me into the "obscure" realm and became too technical.Wonderful exercice.', '2014-12-21 00:20:24.000000', NULL, 0),
